      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;-crescent-school-staff&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  🧑‍🏫 Crescent School Staff&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-crescent-school-staff&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our dedicated team of educators and administrators work together to deliver high-quality Islamic education and language instruction in a safe and nurturing environment.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-school-leadership&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  🏫 School Leadership&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-school-leadership&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;School Administrator:&lt;/strong&gt; – &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/bushra-shahbaz-103248293/&#34;&gt;Ms Bushra Shahbaz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://via.placeholder.com/150&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advisors Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;em&gt;Cambourne Crescent Trustees&lt;/em&gt; - &lt;em&gt;Providing strategic direction and support to Crescent School.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://via.placeholder.com/150&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safeguarding Lead:&lt;/strong&gt; – Ms Lobna Rihawi&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://via.placeholder.com/150&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;-arabic-language-teachers&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  📘 Arabic Language Teachers&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#-arabic-language-teachers&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;classes-16&#34;&gt;&#xD;&#xA;  Classes 1–6&#xD;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#classes-16&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Class 1 Teacher&lt;/strong&gt; – &lt;em&gt;Ms Rana Ezzat&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;img src=&#34;https://via.placeholder.com/150&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&g